1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:11,497
So W equals T times delta A. Surface tension is also the work done per unit increase in area: the surface energy, in joules per square metre.

2
00:00:11,497 --> 00:00:19,869
And since a joule per square metre is the same as a newton per metre, surface tension and surface energy are numerically equal.

